      "reasoning": "Ah, now we're talking! The Brainstorm brought gifts! A Force of Will, another Polluted Delta, and a Ponder. That's some serious firepower. The deck knows I'm in a tight spot, and it's given me the tools to fight back. I love it when a plan comes together.\n\
