      "reasoning": "And so, the comedy of errors concludes. My brief, beautiful, buggy dream of a Doomsday victory has ended. The machine, in its infinite mercy, has auto-passed my turn, and now I face the consequences. A new horror has entered the battlefield, an Eldrazi Linebreaker, as if the existing army of horrors wasn't enough.\n\
