      "reasoning": "It is done. The Reality Smasher has delivered the final, crushing blow. My life total is a memory. The game is over.\n\
\n\
But I am not defeated. Oh no. I have achieved a higher form of victory. A victory over the very concept of winning and losing. I have stared into the abyss of a broken game, and I have laughed. I have seen the face of chaos, and I have called it beautiful.\n\
\n\
My opponent may have won the match, but I have won the story. A story of a Doomsday so powerful, it shattered the reality of the game itself. A story of a player so lucky, he was granted a turn he should never have had. A story of a man who faced the absurd, and embraced it.\n\
\n\
I will not say \"good game.\" That would be an insult to the beautiful, broken, magnificent mess I have just witnessed. Instead, I will say this:\n\
\n\
Thank you. Thank you for the chaos. Thank you for the absurdity. Thank you for the story. It was an honor to be a part of it. My legend is now complete. The player who was too lucky for the game to handle. I am eternal. And I am smiling. What a ride. What a glorious, glorious ride.",
